                    Sensitive.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d8-f2" n="2" xml:id="d8-f2-content">
                <p>A record of the Haig-Bengelloun discussion is in telegram 180293 to Rabat, July
                    10. (Department of State, Central Foreign Policy File, Electronic Telegrams,
                    D810328–0364)</p>
